0:22.410" end="00:22.780">i'm </span><span begin="00:22.780" end="00:23.790">losing </span><span begin="00:23.790" end="00:24.060">my </span><span begin="00:24.060" end="00:24.360">best </span><span begin="00:24.360" end="00:25.716">friend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.420" end="00:26.860"><span begin="00:25.420" end="00:25.980">I </span><span begin="00:25.980" end="00:26.240">can't </span><span begin="00:26.240" end="00:26.853">believe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.560" end="00:31.640"><span begin="00:26.560" end="00:27.260">This </span><span begin="00:27.260" end="00:27.730">could </span><span begin="00:27.730" end="00:28.490">be </span><span begin="00:28.490" end="00:29.280">the </span><span begin="00:29.280" end="00:31.635">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.340" end="00:38.260"><span begin="00:31.340" end="00:31.890">It </span><span begin="00:31.890" end="00:33.250">looks </span><span begin="00:33.250" end="00:33.420">as </span><span begin="00:33.420" end="00:34.830">though </span><span begin="00:34.830" end="00:36.060">you're </span><span begin="00:36.060" end="00:36.670">letting </span><span begin="00:36.670" end="00:38.257">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.960" end="00:39.690"><span begin="00:37.960" end="00:38.520">And </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:38.830">if </span><span begin="00:38.830" end="00:39.250">it's </span><span begin="00:39.250" end="00:39.684">real</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.390" end="00:44.660"><span begin="00:39.390" end="00:40.010">Well </span><span begin="00:40.010" end="00:40.360">i </span><span begin="00:40.360" end="00:40.730">don't </span><span begin="00:40.730" end="00:41.110">want </span><span begin="00:41.110" end="00:41.460">to </span><span begin="00:41.460" end="00:44.656">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.360" end="00:45.880"><span begin="00:44.360" end="00:45.030">Don't </span><span begin="00:45.030" end="00:45.872">speak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.580" end="00:49.310"><span begin="00:45.580" end="00:46.090">I </span><span begin="00:46.090" end="00:46.650">know </span><span begin="00:46.650" end="00:46.850">just </span><span begin="00:46.850" end="00:47.250">what </span><span begin="00:47.250" end="00:47.620">you're </span><span begin="00:47.620" end="00:49.306">saying</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.010" end="00:52.190"><span begin="00:49.010" end="00:49.680">So </span><span begin="00:49.680" end="00:50.030">please </span><span begin="00:50.030" end="00:50.430">stop </span><span begin="00:50.430" end="00:52.184">explaining</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.890" end="00:57.360"><span begin="00:51.890" end="00:52.630">Don't </span><span begin="00:52.630" end="00:53.040">tell </span><span begin="00:53.040" end="00:53.230">me </span><span begin="00:53.230" end="00:53.740">cause </span><span begin="00:53.740" end="00:53.950">it </span><span begin="00:53.950" end="00:57.356">hurts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.060" end="00:58.900"><span begin="00:57.060" end="00:57.720">Don't </span><span begin="00:57.720" end="00:58.892">speak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.600" end="01:02.040"><span begin="00:58.600" end="00:59.140">I </span><span begin="00:59.140" end="00:59.500">know </span><span begin="00:59.500" end="00:59.920">what </span><span begin="00:59.920" end="01:00.240">you're </span><span begin="01:00.240" end="01:02.035">thinking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.740" end="01:04.810"><span begin="01:01.740" end="01:02.230">I </span><span begin="01:02.230" end="01:02.670">don't </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:03.070">need </span><span begin="01:03.070" end="01:03.440">your </span><span begin="01:03.440" end="01:04.805">reasons</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.510" end="01:09.800"><span begin="01:04.510" end="01:05.220">Don't </span><span begin="01:05.220" end="01:05.680">tell </span><span begin="01:05.680" end="01:05.970">me </span><span begin="01:05.970" end="01:06.420">cause </span><span begin="01:06.420" end="01:06.590">it </span><span begin="01:06.590" end="01:09.796">hurts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.533" end="01:13.253"><span begin="01:09.533" end="01:10.123">Our </span><span begin="01:10.123" end="01:13.245">memories</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.953" end="01:15.793"><span begin="01:12.953" end="01:14.003">Well  </span><span begin="01:14.003" end="01:14.353">they </span><span begin="01:14.353" end="01:14.603">can </span><span begin="01:14.603" end="01:14.943">be </span><span begin="01:14.943" end="01:15.788">inviting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.493" end="01:17.513"><span begin="01:15.493" end="01:16.033">But </span><span begin="01:16.033" end="01:16.273">some </span><span begin="01:16.273" end="01:16.533">are </span><span begin="01:16.533" end="01:17.507">altogether</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.213" end="01:22.313"><span begin="01:17.213" end="01:19.083">Mighty </span><span begin="01:19.083" end="01:22.305">frightening</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.013" end="01:29.523"><span begin="01:22.013" end="01:23.683">As </span><span begin="01:23.683" end="01:23.903">we </span><span begin="01:23.903" end="01:25.263">die  </span><span begin="01:25.263" end="01:26.463">both </span><span begin="01:26.463" end="01:26.873">you </span><span begin="01:26.873" end="01:27.083">and </span><span begin="01:27.083" end="01:29.520">i</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.223" end="01:31.013"><span begin="01:29.223" end="01:29.733">With </span><span begin="01:29.733" end="01:30.013">my </span><span begin="01:30.013" end="01:30.283">head </span><span begin="01:30.283" end="01:30.503">in </span><span begin="01:30.503" end="01:30.723">my </span><span begin="01:30.723" end="01:31.009">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.713" end="01:35.123"><span begin="01:30.713" end="01:31.343">I </span><span begin="01:31.343" end="01:31.663">sit </span><span begin="01:31.